t<br>
0000000000000058<br>
[&nbsp; 434.838474] IP: psp_gpu_reset&#43;0xc/0x30 [amdgpu]<br>
[&nbsp; 434.893532] PGD 406ed9067<br>
[&nbsp; 434.893533] P4D 406ed9067<br>
[&nbsp; 434.926376] PUD 400b46067<br>
[&nbsp; 434.959217] PMD 0<br>
[&nbsp; 435.033379] Oops: 0000 [#1] SMP<br>
